## 2. Two configuration flags

Use one master flag and one deep-tracing flag.

```
ENABLE_DETAILED_LOGGING=true
ENABLE_LINE_TRACING=false
```

| Master | Line tracing | Behaviour                     |
| ------ | ------------ | ----------------------------- |
| false  | false        | Normal production             |
| true   | false        | Function, HTTP and DB tracing |
| true   | true         | Deep line-level debugging     |
| false  | true         | Deep tracing disabled         |

For production, keep line tracing off by default.

